WEBVTT

00:36.920 --> 00:38.320
Brother-in-law.

01:05.520 --> 01:11.360
Brother Yiyang has fallen those troops from Wuyang watched from afar the command flag on the tower was replaced.

01:11.440 --> 01:12.840
And have withdrawn.

01:14.160 --> 01:19.600
There was a female general who charged into the city but has been captured I see.

01:19.680 --> 01:22.160
She's a top-class fiery steed.

01:22.880 --> 01:28.600
Clean her up for me after I kill these two sheep I'll go see good.

